{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Farm to Table</strong> is a farming and restaurant management game where your farm feeds your restaurant and your restaurant grows your farm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582250/extras/20612ba752cfa3d6c56d26d4de2e1d36.poster.avif?t=1754900814\" width=610 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582250/extras/20612ba752cfa3d6c56d26d4de2e1d36.webm?t=1754900814\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582250/extras/20612ba752cfa3d6c56d26d4de2e1d36.mp4?t=1754900814\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow crops, plant trees, raise animal buddies for fresh goodies, and get useful machines to make more in-house products.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>Explore. a colorful island, gather wild flavors, fish in the open seas and cook delicious recipes for your hungry guests. Decide if you\u2019ll sell them all at your little Farmer\u2019s market or attract tip-happy returning customers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>Build and decorate your dream place wherever and however you want! Customize with furniture, walls and items any way you like, inside and outside!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Manage resources, improve recipes, hire farmers, chefs, and waiters for extra help, spend the profits to unlock new licences, upgrade your field &amp; grow your business!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf31\u00a0<strong>Plant &amp; Harvest:</strong> Grow plants and trees. Build your farm, one crop at a time!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc2e\u00a0<strong>Raise Livestock:</strong> Raise adorable little buddies right by your kitchen and gather fresh produce.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf7d\ufe0f\u00a0<strong>Cook &amp; Serve:</strong> Set up diverse menus, cook &amp; bake harvest and wild loots into delicious meals attract extra-pay customers!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa3\u00a0<strong>Fish:</strong> Sail away your boat for rare catches!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf3f\u00a0<strong>Explore Flavors:</strong> Pick some wild mushrooms, berries, flowers or explore beehives and much more!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\uded2\u00a0<strong>Market or \ud83c\udfe1 Restaurant:</strong> Stock your shelves, set fair prices for extra profit or just serve your hungry guests!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2699\ufe0f\u00a0<strong>Produce:</strong> Get machines to make more in-house products. Drop stuff in, let the machines turn ingredients into goodies \u2014 flour, butter, and more, all made fresh!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83e\udd1d Manage:</strong> Chefs, waiters &amp; farmers! Hire staff to keep things cooking, and the restaurant running while you explore! Let the helping hands handle the rush!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f Build &amp; </strong>\u2728<strong>Decorate: </strong>Grow your place and give it a personal touch. Decorate endlessly anywhere in any way. Choose from a variety of styles ranging from a tiny cottage garden to a fine dining restaurant, turn it into your dream organic restaurant!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc08\ud83d\udc36 Adopt Furry Pals:</strong> Bring home cute pets that follow you around and make your farm feel alive!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddd1\ud83c\udffb\u200d\ud83c\udf3e\ud83d\udc68\u200d\ud83c\udf73\u00a0<strong>Enjoy Best of Both Worlds:</strong> Take it slow on the farm, then pick up the pace in the kitchen and go explore a colorful wild island!</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3582250?t=1754900814","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582250/fc5840be94e1e66af30cbeaad8be1cbcfb397789/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1754900814","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582250/8ebb66e6e690d2d4c9810913c1ba64fe7094fc25/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754900814","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582250/8ebb66e6e690d2d4c9810913c1ba64fe7094fc25/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754900814","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Farm to Table</strong> is a farming and restaurant management game where your farm feeds your restaurant and your restaurant grows your farm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582250/extras/20612ba752cfa3d6c56d26d4de2e1d36.poster.avif?t=1754900814\" width=610 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582250/extras/20612ba752cfa3d6c56d26d4de2e1d36.webm?t=1754900814\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582250/extras/20612ba752cfa3d6c56d26d4de2e1d36.mp4?t=1754900814\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow crops, plant trees, raise animal buddies for fresh goodies, and get useful machines to make more in-house products.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>Explore. a colorful island, gather wild flavors, fish in the open seas and cook delicious recipes for your hungry guests. Decide if you\u2019ll sell them all at your little Farmer\u2019s market or attract tip-happy returning customers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>Build and decorate your dream place wherever and however you want! Customize with furniture, walls and items any way you like, inside and outside!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Manage resources, improve recipes, hire farmers, chefs, and waiters for extra help, spend the profits to unlock new licences, upgrade your field &amp; grow your business!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf31\u00a0<strong>Plant &amp; Harvest:</strong> Grow plants and trees. Build your farm, one crop at a time!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc2e\u00a0<strong>Raise Livestock:</strong> Raise adorable little buddies right by your kitchen and gather fresh produce.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf7d\ufe0f\u00a0<strong>Cook &amp; Serve:</strong> Set up diverse menus, cook &amp; bake harvest and wild loots into delicious meals attract extra-pay customers!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa3\u00a0<strong>Fish:</strong> Sail away your boat for rare catches!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf3f\u00a0<strong>Explore Flavors:</strong> Pick some wild mushrooms, berries, flowers or explore beehives and much more!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\uded2\u00a0<strong>Market or \ud83c\udfe1 Restaurant:</strong> Stock your shelves, set fair prices for extra profit or just serve your hungry guests!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2699\ufe0f\u00a0<strong>Produce:</strong> Get machines to make more in-house products. Drop stuff in, let the machines turn ingredients into goodies \u2014 flour, butter, and more, all made fresh!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83e\udd1d Manage:</strong> Chefs, waiters &amp; farmers! Hire staff to keep things cooking, and the restaurant running while you explore! Let the helping hands handle the rush!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f Build &amp; </strong>\u2728<strong>Decorate: </strong>Grow your place and give it a personal touch. Decorate endlessly anywhere in any way. Choose from a variety of styles ranging from a tiny cottage garden to a fine dining restaurant, turn it into your dream organic restaurant!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc08\ud83d\udc36 Adopt Furry Pals:</strong> Bring home cute pets that follow you around and make your farm feel alive!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddd1\ud83c\udffb\u200d\ud83c\udf3e\ud83d\udc68\u200d\ud83c\udf73\u00a0<strong>Enjoy Best of Both Worlds:</strong> Take it slow on the farm, then pick up the pace in the kitchen and go explore a colorful wild island!</p></li></ul>","developers":["indieGiant"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582250/3da062c6c2fa86c2c9bf028180ded0ef1a3196cb/header.jpg?t=1754900814","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257171279,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257171279/movie480.mp4?t=1753286115","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257171279/movie_max.mp4?t=1753286115"},"name":"Farm to Table Announcement Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257171279/aba4043ef5c67bdfcf7085652dedbc2ecd399a87/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1753286115","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257171279/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1753286115","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257171279/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1753286115"}},{"highligh